recommend keep-going the first symbol-side unifier stands; the box-drawing family (font5x7_box light, boxdouble, boxdiag, boxarc) is the next natural symbol unifier, then the grand ASCII+Latin1+symbol font. No network, no key, no funds -- no gate reached.
